  "notes": [
    "FoC debug build, Coruscant quick load, seed 12345, tick 0 at frame 345, 30 logical ticks/s; fog revealed to both players and player AI suspended.",
    "The Tartan holds fire, so only the Y-wings change its shield. On tick 30 the squadron gets an Attack_Target order at the Tartan, and the Tartan gets a Move_To order that takes it past the squadron.",
    "On tick 150 the recorder fires the squadron's ION_CANNON_SHOT at the Tartan with Lua Activate_Ability(name, target) on the squadron and on each Y-wing. A remake ability event with a target does the same.",
    "Observed in the private retail clip: the stunned Tartan shows the blue stun aura for about 3 seconds and keeps its cruise speed (IS-05). What the remake predicts: every Y-wing fires one ion bolt (AB-61), each bolt does 50 to the shield and stuns the Tartan (IS-01), and its move under way keeps its speed.",
    "Record-only: no retail trace is committed; the eye check for #561 compares the two clips."
  ]
